  "id": "https://samsm.ch/portfolio-iv/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Portfolio IV - 2019",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003e2019 was another active year for me, with a trip to Venice in July and then a\nlong trip to Barcelona, the U.S, Vietnam, Thailand but mostly Taiwan. I only\nshot colour film in Vietnam and Thailand so those won\u0026rsquo;t appear here, and my film\nfrom Thailand was actually the first film I\u0026rsquo;ve posted to a lab due to running\nout of chems and Corona, and they were annoyingly lost before they made it\nthere.\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003e2019 was another active year for me, with a trip to Venice in July and then a\nlong trip to Barcelona, the U.S, Vietnam, Thailand but mostly Taiwan. I only\nshot colour film in Vietnam and Thailand so those won\u0026rsquo;t appear here, and my film\nfrom Thailand was actually the first film I\u0026rsquo;ve posted to a lab due to running\nout of chems and Corona, and they were annoyingly lost before they made it\nthere.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI didn\u0026rsquo;t do as much towards photo series in 2019 as I would\u0026rsquo;ve liked to. I did\nmake together my \u003ca href=\"/ny-architecture/\"\u003eNew York Architecture post\u003c/a\u003e and put together\n\u003ca href=\"/edgeland-nottingham/\"\u003ea series of images I shot in Nottingham\u003c/a\u003e since I started\nstudying there. I did think about starting a series many times throughout the\nyear but I left Nottingham in June and didn\u0026rsquo;t know where I was going to be in\nthe longer term so I didn\u0026rsquo;t want to start anything big that I wouldn\u0026rsquo;t be able\nto finish.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12609/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12609/12609.avif\"\n         title=\"Brinklow Tower\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a secion of metal fence laying on a grassy verge, atom which is a tall wire fench with a gap in the bottom right, through which the top of an apartment building can be seen\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12609\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eBrinklow Tower\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12907/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12907/12907.avif\"\n         title=\"Wollaton Oak\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a large old bare oak tree in the fog, with frost on the surrounding grass\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12907\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWollaton Oak\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13606/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13606/13606.avif\"\n         title=\"Llangrannog Beach\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo from the inside of a cave at the side of a beach, with rough white waters and then a cliff at the other end of the beach with 2 large houses on the side\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13606\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eLlangrannog Beach\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13611/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13611/13611.avif\"\n         title=\"Talley Woodland\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of an unpaved road through a forest of tall pines on a slope\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13611\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eTalley Woodland\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13803/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13803/13803.avif\"\n         title=\"Wollaton Deer\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a silhouette of a tree at the edge of a lake, under which are two deer\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13803\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eWollaton Deer\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14110/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14110/14110.avif\"\n         title=\"Nordic Pavilion\"\n         alt=\"A wooden door in a concrete wall left of centre, to the right cornered steps rising up two thids of the way up the frame with dark trees in in the background above, black and white\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14110\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eNordic Pavilion\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14507/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14507/14507.avif\"\n         title=\"Chatham Green\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a wide modernist apartment block with a tall windowless tower in the centre\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14507\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eChatham Green\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14611/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14611/14611.avif\"\n         title=\"Americana Submarine\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a corner shop called Americana Submarine taken across a junction underneath an elevated railway\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14611\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eAmericana Submarine\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/14706/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/14706/14706.avif\"\n         title=\"Hilliard Towers\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking up at a rounded curvy brutalist apartment tower behind some trees\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"14706\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eHilliard Towers\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/15304/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/15304/15304.avif\"\n         title=\"Hualien Breakwater\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a breakwater made of large concrete shapes protruding from a rocky beach, being hit by small waves\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"15304\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eHualien Breakwater\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16007/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16007/16007.avif\"\n         title=\"Huajiang Riverside Park\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a park underneath a motorway, with 4 large concrete pillars on the right to centre of the image, and another on the left\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"16007\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eHuajiang Riverside Park\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/16510/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/16510/16510.avif\"\n         title=\"Power Lines\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a dramatic cloudy sky with a small electricity pylon and power lines silhouetted in front\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"16510\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003ePower Lines\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs usual all of these images were, again, shot with my Hasselblad 500C/M and\n60mm CF and 150mm CF lenses on Ilford film. Mostly HP5+ at 400 or 800, but the\nlast shot is at 3200, and two in the middle are Pan F+.\u003c/p\u003e",
